id: pm-beads-1d0b
title: CodeQL action updates split into mutually blocking pull requests
description: Dependabot updates the CodeQL init and analyze actions separately even though CodeQL requires every action in a workflow to run the same release. Update the pair together and group future github/codeql-action updates so each bump remains mergeable.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T15:07:55.071Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T15:13:49.461Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T15:13:49.433Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T15:13:49.433Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T15:13:40.008Z",pi-agent,"Updated every CodeQL action reference from the 4.37.8 SHA to the 4.37.9 SHA and added the github/codeql-action* Dependabot group. Regression proof: with both configuration edits reverted, test/codeql-workflow.test.ts failed on the missing group (exit 1); after restoration, both focused tests passed. npm test passed 380/380; npm run coverage reported 100% lines, branches, and functions across all seven measured source files; npm run docstring documented all 90 declarations; npm run typecheck passed."
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,paired CodeQL init and analyze release pin
  .github/dependabot.yml,project,Dependabot group for CodeQL action family
  test/codeql-workflow.test.ts,project,regression coverage for paired pins and grouping
tests[2]{command,path,scope,timeout_seconds,pm_context_mode,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  npm test,test/codeql-workflow.test.ts,project,120,schema,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T15:13:39.506Z",local_mutation,main
  npm run coverage,package.json,project,180,schema,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T15:13:39.506Z",local_mutation,main
close_reason: "Bumped all CodeQL workflow actions as one release, grouped future Dependabot updates, and added a regression test enforcing both invariants."
